# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(n)$$
- Space complexity: $$O(1)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int longestMonotonicSubarray(int[] nums) {
        int n = nums.length;
        int maxLength = 1;
        int incLength = 1;
        int decLength = 1;
        int i = 1;

        while (i < n) {
            if (nums[i] > nums[i - 1]) {
                incLength++;
                decLength = 1;
            } else if (nums[i] < nums[i - 1]) {
                decLength++;
                incLength = 1;
            } else {
                incLength = 1;
                decLength = 1;
            }
            maxLength = Math.max(maxLength, Math.max(incLength, decLength));
            i++;
        }

        return maxLength;
    }
}
```
